@TaskTracker.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5184

GET {{TaskTracker.Api_HostAddress}}/weatherforecast/
Accept: application/json

###
### Get all tasks
GET {{TaskTracker.Api_HostAddress}}/api/tasks
Accept: application/json

### Get task 2
GET {{TaskTracker.Api_HostAddress}}/api/tasks/2
Accept: application/json

### Get task that does not exist
GET {{TaskTracker.Api_HostAddress}}/api/tasks/99
Accept: application/json
